.TH HSH 1 "August 2026" "Holberton" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hsh \- a simple command line interpreter / shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hsh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hsh
is a simple UNIX command interpreter that executes commands read from standard input or from a file.
.SH INVOCATION
.B hsh
can be invoked interactively or non-interactively.
.P
In interactive mode, a prompt `($)` is displayed before reading commands.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B hsh
returns the exit status of the last command executed.
.SH SEE ALSO
sh(1)
